# Landscape pilot (docs/landscape-plan.md, step В1): the area of chunks 4_-2 … 7_1 around the tavern as the player
# sees it now — the reference of the intent sheet and the «сейчас» half of the pilot's pairs and clips
# (reports/content/2026-11-landscape-pilot/README.md). Each spot gives four shots <spot>-1..4 of the game's own
# camera, the hero turned by 90° between them (1: along the path); five spots again at night (<spot>-night-1, -2:
# along the path and back). Clips: `walk-road` runs from the road south of Akil's farm over the bridge and along
# the cliff to the crossroads at the tavern and on to the road to Onar's farm; `walk-forest` runs from the road into
# the forest towards the cave. Change the spots only together with the note: later runs are compared with these.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh landscape-pilot
# @timeout 1200
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
set time 12 0

# the road up from the city, west edge of the area
goto NW_CITY_TO_FARM2_04
clear 3000
face wp NW_CITY_TO_FARM2_06
streaming wait
wait 5000
shot city-road-1
wait 200
turn 90
wait 2500
shot city-road-2
wait 200
turn 90
wait 2500
shot city-road-3
wait 200
turn 90
wait 2500
shot city-road-4
wait 200

